WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
13:00 — Log a visit. Dee logs a Karachi lunch on her phone before the walk back — place, dish, a private rating, no performance for strangers.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
13:20 — Rate it. Same phone: she adjusts the rating while the taste is still honest, not after a week of forgetting.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
18:00 — Map. Map of eats on the phone shows where she has been; useful for her, not a public flex.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
21:00 — Taste profile. Taste profile at night is a quiet summary — what she actually likes, not what she thinks she should like.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
21:30 — Wishlist. Wishlist gets one pin for next weekend. The journal stays hers. Private beta screens, fictional visits.

